        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employee 925</strong> is a short <strong>psychological horror</strong> and <strong>narrative experiment</strong> about work, obedience, and the cost of denying yourself to become what the system expects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive.<br>You comply.<br>You complete your <strong>mandatory training</strong> — again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow every instruction, communicate with your co-worker through <strong>Morse code</strong>, and measure your worth in a place where success means erasing who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress will be logged.<br>Your cooperation will be acknowledged.<br>Your understanding is not required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~60 minute experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique communication mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal reflection on conformity, ambition, and the loss of identity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Speedrun mode - try to beat your best time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested and runs great on Steam Deck </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who enjoyed <strong>The Stanley Parable</strong>, <strong>Severance</strong>, and minimalist psychological horror.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employee 925</strong> is a short <strong>psychological horror</strong> and <strong>narrative experiment</strong> about work, obedience, and the cost of denying yourself to become what the system expects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive.<br>You comply.<br>You complete your <strong>mandatory training</strong> — again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow every instruction, communicate with your co-worker through <strong>Morse code</strong>, and measure your worth in a place where success means erasing who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress will be logged.<br>Your cooperation will be acknowledged.<br>Your understanding is not required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~60 minute experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique communication mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal reflection on conformity, ambition, and the loss of identity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Speedrun mode - try to beat your best time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested and runs great on Steam Deck </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who enjoyed <strong>The Stanley Parable</strong>, <strong>Severance</strong>, and minimalist psychological horror.</p>",
